{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35465","headline":"仙都即景 · 曹唐","name":"仙都即景","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟠桃花老华阳东，轩后登真谢六宫。\n旌节暗迎归碧落，笙歌遥听隔崆峒。\n衣冠留葬桥山月，劒履将随浪海风。\n看却龙髯攀不得，红霞零落鼎湖空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}